      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "PhysBones are unique to VRChat will most likely not be sold, its an application-unique feature that will bring users to VRChat. The creator of the Dynamic Bones system has an updated version that would fit your needs and has similar performance to the optimized PhysBone system.\nContrasty, VRChat's unique PhysBone system is tuned specifically for the application and to deal with multiple players at once, hence why it is optimized for performance and interactivity.",
