      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Game developer: I want good dynamics assets.... Okay, let's VRChat!\nI don't think they would think that....\nI think it is a great feature but not of the nature to attract users.\nThat said, I agree that as it stands it will probably never be released.\nThat's why I posted this on Requests.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
